    <main id="main" class="page">
      
<div class="check" data-cardio data-rest="300" data-duration="90" data-demo="1" data-usual="76">

  <!-- Overview -->
  <section class="step" data-step="overview">
    <div class="overview">
      <div class="overview__main">
        <p class="lede">Rest for five minutes, then hold still for 90 seconds while the wearable reads your pulse and oxygen. You'll get a plain answer and what to do next.</p>
        <p class="wear-line" data-wear-line aria-live="polite">Checking the wearable…</p>
        <div class="overview__actions">
          <button class="pill pill--primary" type="button" data-go="precheck"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/vendor/lucide/sprite.svg#play"></use></svg>Start assessment</button>
          <p class="card__meta">Last check Nov 14, 10:55</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="rows overview__latest" aria-label="Latest heart readings">
        
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row__label">Heart rate</span>
          <span class="row__right"><span class="row__value">104 bpm</span>
            <span class="verdict is-watch">A bit high</span></span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row__label">Blood pressure</span>
          <span class="row__right"><span class="row__value">118/76 mmHg</span>
            <span class="verdict is-good">Good</span></span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row__label">Oxygen</span>
          <span class="row__right"><span class="row__value">98 %</span>
            <span class="verdict is-good">Good</span></span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row__label">Blood sugar</span>
          <span class="row__right"><span class="row__value">81 mg/dL</span>
            <span class="verdict is-good">Good</span></span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row__label">Breathing</span>
          <span class="row__right"><span class="row__value">14 br/min</span>
            <span class="verdict is-good">Good</span></span>
        </li>
        
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row__label">Temperature</span>
          <span class="row__right"><span class="row__value">36.0 °C</span>
            <span class="verdict is-okay">Okay</span></span>
        </li>
        
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card trend">
      <div class="card__head">
        <h2 class="card__title">Last 30 days</h2>
        <div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="Chart">
          <button type="button" class="segmented__item" data-trend="heart_rate" aria-pressed="true">Heart rate</button>
          <button type="button" class="segmented__item" data-trend="blood_pressure" aria-pressed="false">Blood pressure</button>
          <button type="button" class="segmented__item" data-trend="spo2" aria-pressed="false">Oxygen</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trend__canvas"><canvas data-trend-canvas aria-describedby="trend-summary" role="img"></canvas></div>
      <p class="visually-hidden" id="trend-summary" data-trend-summary></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pre-check -->
  <section class="step" data-step="precheck" hidden>
    <div class="precheck">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="card__title">Before you start</h2>
        <ol class="steps steps--roomy">
          <li><strong>Sit still for five minutes.</strong> Feet anchored (in zero gravity, hook them under a rail), arm resting at heart level.</li>
          <li><strong>Rest one fingertip lightly on the pulse sensor.</strong> Keep the hand still and relaxed. Pressing hard spoils the reading.</li>
          <li><strong>Put the temperature probe under your arm</strong> and keep the arm down, ideally ten minutes before the check.</li>
          <li><strong>Have a cuff or glucometer?</strong> You can type their readings during the check.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="why"><strong>Why it matters in space.</strong> Without gravity, fluid shifts toward your head and the heart gets lazier. That shows up as a higher resting pulse, blood-pressure changes and dizziness on landing. Radiation also adds long-term heart risk.</p>
      </div>
      <form class="card" data-precheck-form>
        <fieldset class="choice-list">
          <legend class="card__title">When did you last eat?</legend>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="glucose_context" value="fasting"><span>More than 8 hours ago</span></label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="glucose_context" value="post_meal"><span>About 2 hours ago</span></label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="glucose_context" value="random" checked><span>Something else / not sure</span></label>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="choice-list symptoms">
          <legend class="card__title">Do you have any of these right now?</legend>
          
          <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="symptoms" value="chest_pain"><span>Chest pain</span></label>
          
          <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="symptoms" value="severe_headache"><span>A severe headache</span></label>
          
          <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="symptoms" value="vision_changes"><span>Vision changes</span></label>
          
          <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="symptoms" value="short_of_breath"><span>Severe shortness of breath</span></label>
          
          <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="symptoms" value="fainting"><span>Fainting</span></label>
          
          <p class="card__meta">Any tick means "Get help now", whatever the numbers say.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <p class="form-error" data-precheck-error hidden></p>
        <div class="panel__actions">
          <button class="pill pill--ghost" type="button" data-go="overview">Back</button>
          <button class="pill pill--primary" type="submit">Start the rest</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Rest countdown + handshake -->
  <section class="step rest" data-step="rest" hidden>
    <div class="ring" role="timer" aria-live="off">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="ring__track" cx="60" cy="60" r="54"/><circle class="ring__fill" data-ring cx="60" cy="60" r="54"/></svg>
      <div class="ring__label"><span class="ring__time" data-rest-time>5:00</span><span class="card__meta">Rest and breathe normally</span></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="handshake" data-handshake aria-live="polite"></ul>
    <div class="panel__actions">
      <button class="pill pill--ghost" type="button" data-cancel>Cancel</button>
      <button class="pill pill--ghost" type="button" data-skip-rest>Skip the rest (demo)</button>
      <button class="pill pill--primary" type="button" data-start-measure disabled>Start measuring</button>
    </div>
    <details class="strap">
      <summary>Use a Bluetooth chest strap or type readings instead</summary>
      <div class="strap__body">
        <button class="pill pill--ghost pill--small" type="button" data-ble hidden><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/vendor/lucide/sprite.svg#bluetooth"></use></svg>Connect chest strap</button>
        <p class="card__meta" data-ble-note></p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <!-- Live session -->
  <section class="step live" data-step="live" hidden>
    <div class="live__head">
      <p class="live__status"><span class="dot is-alert" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-live-status>Heart check in progress</span></p>
      <p class="live__left" data-time-left aria-live="off"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="bpm">
      <svg class="bpm__heart" data-heart aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="/static/vendor/lucide/sprite.svg#heart"></use></svg>
      <p class="bpm__value"><span data-bpm>–</span><span class="bpm__unit">bpm</span></p>
    </div>
    <p class="bpm__verdict" data-bpm-verdict></p>
    <p class="bpm__note" data-bpm-note>Stay still and breathe normally.</p>
    <div class="wave" aria-label="Heartbeat waveform" role="img"><canvas data-wave></canvas></div>
    <ul class="vitals" data-vitals></ul>
    <form class="manual" data-manual-form>
      <p class="card__meta">Have a cuff, glucometer or oximeter? Type a reading:</p>
      <select class="field__input" name="metric" aria-label="Which reading">
        <option value="blood_pressure">Blood pressure</option>
        <option value="glucose">Blood sugar</option>
        <option value="spo2">Oxygen</option>
        <option value="temperature_c">Temperature</option>
        <option value="heart_rate">Heart rate</option>
        <option value="respiration">Breathing rate</option>
      </select>
      <input class="field__input" name="value" inputmode="decimal" aria-label="Value" placeholder="Value" required>
      <input class="field__input" name="value2" inputmode="decimal" aria-label="Lower blood pressure number" placeholder="Lower number">
      <button class="pill pill--ghost" type="submit">Save reading</button>
      <p class="form-error" data-manual-message hidden></p>
    </form>
    <div class="panel__actions live__actions">
      <button class="pill pill--ghost" type="button" data-pause>Pause</button>
      <button class="pill pill--primary" type="button" data-finish>Finish check</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Results -->
  <section class="step results" data-step="results" hidden>
    <div class="results__head">
      <span data-result-status></span>
      <h2 class="headline" data-result-title></h2>
      <p class="lede" data-result-text></p>
      <p class="form-error" data-result-symptoms hidden></p>
      <p class="card__meta" data-result-rest></p>
    </div>
    <div class="results__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="card__title">Your numbers</h3>
        <ul class="rows" data-result-rows></ul>
        <ul class="notes" data-result-messages></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="card__title">What to do</h3>
        <ol class="steps steps--roomy" data-result-actions></ol>
        <p class="card__meta" data-result-remeasure></p>
        <div class="panel__actions">
          <a class="pill pill--primary" href="/dashboard">Back to Today</a>
          <a class="pill pill--ghost" href="/doctor">Ask Dr. NOVA</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card results__chart">
        <h3 class="card__title">Compared with your last checks</h3>
        <div class="trend__canvas"><canvas data-result-chart role="img" aria-describedby="result-chart-text"></canvas></div>
        <p class="visually-hidden" id="result-chart-text" data-result-chart-text></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

    </main>
    <footer class="site-foot">Prototype for educational purposes. Not a certified medical device.</footer>
  </div>
</div>


<dialog class="dialog" id="env-dialog" aria-labelledby="env-title">
  <form class="dialog__body" data-env-form>
    <h2 class="dialog__title" id="env-title">Where is the crew?</h2>
    <p class="dialog__lede">This changes gravity, the delay to Earth and the exercises on offer. It never changes the health ranges.</p>
    <fieldset class="choice-list">
      <legend class="visually-hidden">Mission environment</legend>
      
      <label class="choice">
        <input type="radio" name="environment" value="Spacecraft">
        <span class="choice__label">Spacecraft</span>
      </label>
      
      <label class="choice">
        <input type="radio" name="environment" value="Space Station" checked>
        <span class="choice__label">Space Station</span>
      </label>
      
      <label class="choice">
        <input type="radio" name="environment" value="Rover">
        <span class="choice__label">Rover</span>
      </label>
      
      <label class="choice">
        <input type="radio" name="environment" value="Lunar Base">
        <span class="choice__label">Lunar Base</span>
      </label>
      
      <label class="choice">
        <input type="radio" name="environment" value="Mars Base">
        <span class="choice__label">Mars Base</span>
      </label>
      
    </fieldset>
    <p class="form-error" data-env-error hidden></p>
    <div class="dialog__actions">
      <button class="pill pill--ghost" type="button" data-close-dialog>Cancel</button>
      <button class="pill pill--primary" type="submit">Save location</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>


<dialog class="dialog" id="protocol-dialog" aria-labelledby="protocol-title">
  <div class="dialog__body">
    <h2 class="dialog__title" id="protocol-title">What to do now</h2>
    <ol class="steps" data-protocol-steps></ol>
    <div class="dialog__actions">
